<div n="1" type="contents"><list><head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Ueber&#x017F;icht</hi>.</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<item><hi rendition="#b">Die engli&#x017F;che Expedition gegen die Lu&#x017F;chai.</hi></item><lb/>
